#34700
The Begining~
The Museum of Mortals is a little exp area and allows players to have statues
erected to themselves for a fee.  It also contains statues of famous or
infamous players from Raven's past for the education of touristy newbies.  
Mobs are lvls 1-50 and align alternates in each room.  This area is linked to
Samserra 18080
~
347 0 0 0 0 0 255 0
D0
~
~
0 0 34701
S
#34701
The Museum Entrance~
Before you is a an imposing granite ediface lined with alternating black and
white marble columns.  The arched entranceway is open and a steady stream of
visitors comes and goes.  Carved over the entrance is:;


      &04****************************************&00
      &04****************************************&00
      &04**********  MUSEUM OF MORTALS  *********&00
      &04****************************************&00
      &04****************************************&00



    &25   Please have ticket ready&00


~
347 12 0 0 0 0 255 0
D1
Your way is blocked
~
turnstile~
1 34700 34702
D3
you see an exitway
~
~
0 0 18080
S
#34702
The Museum hallway~
You are in a vast hallway lined with columns in double pillars marching away
out of sight.  As you walk you see to either side of you a tall niche carved
out of the solid marble walls.  Each niche is adorned with gold-plated
scroll-work and within is a large crystal pedestal.  Resting on each pedestal
is a tall cold stone figure looming over you and staring outwards with blind
marble eyes.    
~
